OL,3,GNEWSABenedetti to stay on as Edinburgh
OL,4,AInternational Festival director
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicola Benedetti is to stay on as
OL,7,Fdirector of the Edinburgh International
OL,8,FFestival for a further two years.
OL,10,FThe award-winning violinist was the
OL,11,Ffirst Scot and the first woman to take
OL,12,Fup the post when she was appointed in
OL,13,F2022.
OL,15,FFour years and four festivals later,
OL,16,Fshe believes she needs more time to
OL,17,Fcontinue the work she and her team have
OL,18,Fbegun.
OL,20,F"I think the things that we signed up
OL,21,Fto try to achieve were never going to
OL,22,Fbe quick short term fixes," she says.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
